&                &                   & - \dfrac{\Big[n^2+\Big(\dfrac{1}{2}\Big)^2\Big]\Big[n^2+\Big(\dfrac{3}{2}\Big)^2\Big]\Big[n^2+\Big(\dfrac{5}{2}\Big)^2\Big]}{2^2(3!)^2}(x-1)^3+\cdots&
\end{align*}$$ and\
$$\begin{align*}
